sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend (Discover)
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Nominatim

    Note over User,FE: City autocomplete

    User->>FE: type city name
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/search/cities?q=...
    BE->>DB: distinct location.city (regex match)
    DB-->>BE: city suggestions
    BE-->>FE: cities[]

    Note over User,FE: Optional address geocoding

    User->>FE: enter address
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/geocode?q=...
    BE->>Nominatim: forward query (rate-limited proxy)
    Nominatim-->>BE: address candidates with lat/lng
    BE-->>FE: results[]

    Note over User,FE: Profile search

    User->>FE: pick city + niche + platform filters
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/search/profiles?city&niche&platform
    BE->>BE: validate filters (Zod)
    BE->>DB: find profiles where location.city, niche, socialAccounts.platform match
    DB-->>BE: matching profiles (limit 20)
    BE-->>FE: profiles[]
    FE-->>User: render ProfileGrid cards
